{
  "schema": "openclaw_napm_summary_template.v1",
  "templateId": "napm_summary_overview_v1",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "titlePath": "title",
  "description": "NAPM 综述报告统一模板。通过 scopes 字段驱动章节显隐，一套模板覆盖全局综述、网络综述、业务综述、应用综述、业务组综述和告警综述。",
  "page": {
    "margin": {
      "top": 1000,
      "right": 900,
      "bottom": 1000,
      "left": 900,
      "header": 450,
      "footer": 450
    },
    "header": {
      "leftImage": {
        "path": "templates/inspection/company-logo.png",
        "width": 110,
        "height": 32,
        "alt": "网深科技基于AI的全流量性能分析平台"
      },
      "left": "网深科技基于AI的全流量性能分析平台",
      "right": "{{summary.customerName}}{{summary.projectName}}{{scope.label}}报告"
    },
    "footer": {
      "center": "第 {{pageNumber}} 页 / 共 {{totalPages}} 页",
      "right": "{{summary.reportDate}}"
    }
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "cover",
      "type": "cover",
      "title": "网深科技基于AI的全流量性能分析平台",
      "subtitle": "{{scope.label}}报告"
    },
    {
      "id": "cover_date",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "alignment": "center",
      "size": 22,
      "paragraphs": [
        "{{summary.reportDate}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cover_break",
      "type": "pageBreak"
    },
    {
      "id": "toc",
      "type": "toc",
      "title": "目录",
      "alias": "Summary Report TOC",
      "headingStyleRange": "1-2",
      "hyperlink": true,
      "updateMode": "wordField"
    },
    {
      "id": "toc_break",
      "type": "pageBreak"
    },

    {
      "id": "overview_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "1 报告概述",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "overview_scope_info",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "paragraphs": [
        "综述范围：{{scope.label}}",
        "时间范围：{{timeRange.displayText}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview_scope_target",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "scopes": ["webApplication", "application", "businessGroup", "network"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "paragraphs": [
        "聚焦对象：{{scope.target.groupLabel}}（{{scope.target.groupType}}）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "device_info_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "设备信息",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "device_info_intro",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "paragraphs": [
        "本次综述涉及的 NetInside 基于AI的全流量性能分析平台设备信息如下："
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "device_info_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "summaryDeviceTable",
      "columns": [
        "编号",
        "系统名称",
        "IP地址",
        "软件版本",
        "序列号",
        "启动时长"
      ]
    },


    {
      "id": "webapp_target_access_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "3 单个业务访问分析",
      "level": 1,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_access_requirement",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "paragraphs": [
        "以下内容按照前端单个业务分析（BsAna）口径生成，覆盖访问概要、访问趋势、节点分布、资源使用、客户端响应和 HTTP 响应码统计。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_overview_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "业务分析概要",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_overview_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessTargetOverview",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "columns": [
        "指标",
        "值"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_access_slow_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "访问量和慢业务趋势",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_access_slow_chart",
      "type": "chartSlot",
      "title": "访问量和慢业务趋势图",
      "chartId": "webapp.accessSlow",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_node_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "不同节点访问量和慢业务分布",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_node_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessTargetNodeDistribution",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "caption": "Top 5 业务组节点",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "业务组节点",
        "访问数",
        "慢访问数"
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "webapp_target_resource_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "4 单个业务资源与 HTTP 分析",
      "level": 1,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_resource_requirement",
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "paragraphs": [
        "以下内容展示该业务的资源使用情况、请求/响应流量变化、慢客户端分布以及 HTTP 响应码与错误客户端统计。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_resource_summary_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "业务资源使用统计",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_resource_summary_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessTargetResourceSummary",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "columns": [
        "指标",
        "值"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_request_response_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "请求/响应流量趋势",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_request_response_chart",
      "type": "chartSlot",
      "title": "请求/响应流量趋势图",
      "chartId": "webapp.requestResponse",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_slow_clients_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "最慢客户端 Top N",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_slow_clients_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessTargetSlowClients",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "caption": "Top 5 最慢客户端",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "客户端IP",
        "响应时间(秒)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_http_code_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "HTTP 响应代码统计",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_http_code_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessTargetHttpCodeSummary",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "columns": [
        "响应代码",
        "数量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_http400_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "400 错误客户端 Top N",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_http400_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessTargetHttp400Clients",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "caption": "Top 5 HTTP 400 客户端",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "客户端IP",
        "数量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_http500_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "500 错误客户端 Top N",
      "level": 2,
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_http500_table",
      "type": "table",
      "rowBuilder": "businessTargetHttp500Clients",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"],
      "caption": "Top 5 HTTP 500 客户端",
      "columns": [
        "序号",
        "客户端IP",
        "数量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "webapp_target_narrative",
      "type": "narrative",
      "ruleGroup": "business.target.conclusion",
      "mode": "first",
      "scopes": ["webApplication"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },

    {
      "id": "app_target_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "3 应用剖析",
      "level": 1,
      "scopes": ["application"],
      "targetModes": ["withTarget"]
    },
    {
      "id": "app_target_overview_heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "title": "应用性能概览",
